[[512,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative (-) terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235042\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Undo nuts (1a) and move fuel filter assembly (1b) away from the\nintake manifold.</p><p>2. Undo nuts (2a) and move oil vapour separator (2b) away from the\nintake manifold.</p><p>3. Undo the bolts (3a) and move the fuel return manifold pipe (3b)\naside.</p><p>4. Disconnect the electrical leads from the heater plugs.</p><p>5. Undo and remove the heater plugs.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Heater plug</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235110\">A40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018707.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[512,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the glow  plugs and tighten them to\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>GLOW PLUGS</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.3 - 1.6</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical leads to the heater\nplugs.</p><p>Place the fuel return manifold pipe back\nin its housign and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Place the oil vapour separator back in\nits housing and fix it using the bolts.</p><p>Place the fuel filter back in its housing\nand secure with the nuts.</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal</p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the heater plugs.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Heater plug</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235110\">A40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo and remove the glow plugs.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070068.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the glow plugs back in their housings\nand tighten them to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>GLOW PLUGS</p></td><td><p>M9</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side) 0.7 ÷ 0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nheater plugs.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the heater plugs.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Heater plug</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235110\">A40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo and remove the glow plugs.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070069.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the glow plugs back in their housings\nand tighten them to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nheater plugs.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"]]